// Dimensions of the utility 4x4 for pictures and tests, PROVISIONAL(C-002) until FORGE passes the real hull Params. Set to the M998 class:
// the dossier (content/dossier/m998.ron, every figure there UNVERIFIED secondary) gives static.length_m 4.572, static.width_m 2.159,
// static.height_m 1.7907 (band 1.7526 to 1.8288, ground to roof), static.wheelbase_m 3.302 and static.ground_clearance_m 0.4064 to 0.4318;
// the track and the tyre (diameter 0.82, section 0.30) are the Mule's (content/vehicles/game/mule_4x4.ron: track 1.82, wheelbase 3.30),
// so the skin sits on the Mule's physics rig. The hull box is measured from the underside, so its height is the overall height minus the
// clearance: 1.79 - 0.42 = 1.37 m. Provenance ESTIMATE, band +-5% each, reason: the vehicle is a fictional design in the M998 class.
UtilityDims(
    length_m: 4.572,
    width_m: 2.159,
    height_m: 1.37,
    wheelbase_m: 3.302,
    track_m: 1.82,
    ground_clearance_m: 0.42,
    wheel: (outer_radius_m: 0.41, width_m: 0.30, rim_radius_m: 0.25, lug_depth_m: 0.02, lugs_around: 28),
)
